{"seq":1,"slug":"dispatch-assignment-driver-workflow","title":"派单分配与司机作业流：任务派发、接单确认与到场签到闭环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/port-drayage-truck-appointment-container-dispatch-system/dispatch-execution-visibility-exception/dispatch-assignment-driver-workflow","wordCount":3059,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"派单分配与司机作业流-任务派发-接单确认与到场签到闭环\">派单分配与司机作业流：任务派发、接单确认与到场签到闭环</h1><p>短驳调度里最容易被低估的一段，是&quot;预约已经抢到、箱子已经在场、车却在路上&quot;之间的那段时间。码头预约只解决了资源侧的占位（见 <a href=\"../terminal-appointment-window-scheduling/appointment-window-quota-model\">码头预约时段与配额模型</a>），而从&quot;这票任务交给谁&quot;到&quot;司机真的把车停在闸口前&quot;，中间隔着一整条状态机：任务派发、接单确认、出车、导航、到场签到、进闸核验。这条链路一旦断裂，预约名额会被浪费成码头眼里的 no-show，车队则要为一票货重复争抢两次窗口。本文把这条链路拆成可实现的字段与状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-派单是-任务-司机-设备-的三元匹配与双向承诺\">核心概念：派单是&quot;任务-司机-设备&quot;的三元匹配与双向承诺</h2><p>派单（dispatch assignment）在系统里不是一个动作，而是把一个<strong>待执行任务</strong>绑定到一个<strong>司机</strong>和一套<strong>设备</strong>（牵引车 + 底盘 + 集装箱）上，并要求两端都做出承诺的过程。任务形态由业务动作决定，短驳场景至少有四类基本任务，它们对设备与场地的要求不同，也决定了派单时要校验的字段不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>任务类型</th>\n<th>起点</th>\n<th>终点</th>\n<th>关键校验</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>提重箱 Import Pickup</td>\n<td>码头堆场</td>\n<td>收货人仓库</td>\n<td>预约号、提单放行、底盘可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>还空箱 Empty Return</td>\n<td>仓库 / 堆场</td>\n<td>指定空箱场站</td>\n<td>箱况 EIR、免箱期剩余</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提空箱 Export Empty</td>\n<td>空箱场站</td>\n<td>出口仓库</td>\n<td>订舱号、箱型匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>送重箱 Export Laden</td>\n<td>出口仓库</td>\n<td>码头堆场</td>\n<td>截关时间、预约窗口</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>派单的核心矛盾在于：系统的<strong>分配逻辑</strong>（谁该拉这票）和司机的<strong>接受逻辑</strong>（我愿不愿意拉、能不能按时到）不总是一致。因此成熟的派单不是&quot;系统单方面指派&quot;，而是一次带超时的<strong>双向承诺握手</strong>：系统发出要约（offer），司机在限定时间内接受或拒绝，超时未响应则要约失效并回收给下一个候选。短驳的约束比外卖派单更硬——车是一台几十吨的牵引车，司机受美国联邦机动车安全管理局（FMCSA）工时规则约束，不能无限接单。</p>\n<p>工时的法律边界必须进入派单模型。FMCSA 的电子记录设备（ELD）规则位于 49 CFR Part 395 Subpart B，对多数州际承运人要求自动记录发动机小时、里程、位置与时间戳（来源：FMCSA, Electronic Logging Devices, 49 CFR Part 395 Subpart B）。这意味着司机的&quot;可接单容量&quot;不是主观意愿，而是由<strong>剩余可驾驶时间</strong>这个硬约束推算出的实数：若某司机已接近 11 小时驾驶上限（49 CFR 395.3），系统就不应再向其派发需要长距离空驶回程的任务。派单算法要把工时余量作为一等的约束项，而非事后校验。</p>\n<p>任务本身的状态推进则挂在集装箱移动生命周期上（见 <a href=\"../drayage-network-operating-model/container-move-lifecycle-status-model\">集装箱移动生命周期与状态模型</a>）。派单只负责&quot;已计划 → 已指派 → 已确认 → 在途 → 已到场&quot;这一段，它与码头侧的闸口事件（gate-in / gate-out）在&quot;已到场&quot;处汇合，之后由闸口报文接管。</p>\n<h2 id=\"派单分配-从候选集生成到要约-接受状态机\">派单分配：从候选集生成到要约-接受状态机</h2><p>一次完整的派单在系统内经历固定的几个阶段，任何跳步都会导致后期无法解释&quot;为什么这票货没人接&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[任务进入待派单池&lt;br/&gt;携带预约号与时间窗] --&gt; B{候选司机筛选}&#10;  B --&gt;|资质/工时/设备校验| C[生成候选集并打分]&#10;  C --&gt; D[向最优候选发出要约 offer]&#10;  D --&gt; E{司机响应}&#10;  E --&gt;|接受 accept| F[绑定 任务-司机-设备&lt;br/&gt;状态: 已确认 Assigned]&#10;  E --&gt;|拒绝 decline| G[记录原因 回到候选集]&#10;  E --&gt;|超时 timeout| G&#10;  G --&gt; H{候选集是否耗尽}&#10;  H --&gt;|否| D&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[升级为改派异常&lt;br/&gt;转人工/跨车队]&#10;  F --&gt; J[司机出车在途]&#10;  J --&gt; K[到场签到 触发 geofence]&#10;  K --&gt; L{签到时刻 vs 预约窗口}&#10;  L --&gt;|在容差内| M[进场 闸口核验]&#10;  L --&gt;|超出容差| N[记录逾期 争取窗口顺延]\">flowchart TD\n  A[任务进入待派单池&lt;br/&gt;携带预约号与时间窗] --&gt; B{候选司机筛选}\n  B --&gt;|资质/工时/设备校验| C[生成候选集并打分]\n  C --&gt; D[向最优候选发出要约 offer]\n  D --&gt; E{司机响应}\n  E --&gt;|接受 accept| F[绑定 任务-司机-设备&lt;br/&gt;状态: 已确认 Assigned]\n  E --&gt;|拒绝 decline| G[记录原因 回到候选集]\n  E --&gt;|超时 timeout| G\n  G --&gt; H{候选集是否耗尽}\n  H --&gt;|否| D\n  H --&gt;|是| I[升级为改派异常&lt;br/&gt;转人工/跨车队]\n  F --&gt; J[司机出车在途]\n  J --&gt; K[到场签到 触发 geofence]\n  K --&gt; L{签到时刻 vs 预约窗口}\n  L --&gt;|在容差内| M[进场 闸口核验]\n  L --&gt;|超出容差| N[记录逾期 争取窗口顺延]</pre><p><strong>候选集生成</strong>是纯约束过滤：司机的 USDOT/MC 资质是否有效、车辆是否符合该码头要求（部分码头对车龄、EPA 尾气年份有限制）、底盘型号是否匹配箱型、剩余可驾驶工时是否足够。这些过滤项一旦被跳过往打分，就会出现&quot;派一个没有该码头进闸权限的司机&quot;这类事故。</p>\n<p><strong>打分</strong>决定要约顺序。一个可解释的代价函数把距离、时间紧迫度与成本揉进一个标量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(i, j) = w_d \\cdot d_{ij} + w_t \\cdot \\max\\!\\left(0,\\; t^{ready}_i - t^{avail}_j\\right) + w_c \\cdot c_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是司机 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 当前点到任务 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 起点的实际道路距离（不是直线距离），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t^{ready}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2439em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是任务就绪时间、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t^{avail}_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2439em;vertical-align:-0.3948em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3948em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是司机可到位时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是边际成本系数。三个权重是可配置策略参数——旺季偏 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（抢时间），淡季偏 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（压成本）。</p>\n<p><strong>要约-接受状态机</strong>决定系统在司机不响应时的行为是否可预测。要约必须有到期时间（常见 60–180 秒），到期即失效，且失效要与&quot;明确拒绝&quot;分开记录：前者可稍后重试，后者不应再向该司机发同一票。要约还须<strong>幂等且独占</strong>——同一任务同一时刻只能有一个有效要约，否则会出现两个司机同时接受、系统无从裁决的竞态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"司机端作业流-接单确认-出车检查与导航\">司机端作业流：接单确认、出车检查与导航</h2><p>司机端不是把后台的字段照搬上手机，而是把派单结果翻译成一串&quot;下一步做什么&quot;的指令：确认、检查、导航，每一件都对应后台一个状态跃迁。</p>\n<p><strong>接单确认</strong>必须回传的不只是&quot;接受&quot;这一个布尔值，至少还应带上实际到位的预计时间（ETA）与车辆/底盘编号。底盘编号尤其重要：预约与 EIR 都以底盘号为设备交换的主键，若司机到场才发现底盘与派单记录不一致，闸口会拒绝交换。接单回执包含底盘号，等价于让司机在出发前完成一次设备自查。</p>\n<p><strong>出车检查</strong>对应 EIR 的前置。司机在提箱前要记录箱体外观（损伤代码、铅封号、箱门状态），这些数据在闸口交换时成为责任分界证据。这一步是司机端的结构化表单提交而非自由文本——损伤代码应当来自受控词表，照片作为佐证而非唯一载体。</p>\n<p><strong>导航</strong>要把目的地按任务类型切换：提重箱导航到具体码头与堆场区块，还空箱导航到指定空箱场站，映射作为配置项维护。同时要处理&quot;进闸路线&quot;与&quot;公共道路&quot;的差异：码头内部道路常有单向循环与临时封闭，成熟做法是接入码头方发布的进场指引图作为导航尾部的一段静态指引。</p>\n<h2 id=\"到场签到闭环-geofence-eld-与闸口事件三方对账\">到场签到闭环：geofence、ELD 与闸口事件三方对账</h2><p>&quot;到家门口了&quot;这件事在短驳系统里必须由**地理围栏（geofence）**判定，而不是司机手点一个&quot;我已到场&quot;。手点签到会被滥用，也无法为免箱期争议提供中立证据。geofence 的判定是一个半径测试：给定围栏圆心 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>φ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\varphi_0, \\lambda_0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，以 haversine 公式计算司机上报点到圆心的球面距离：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><mi>arcsin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><msqrt><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>φ</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>φ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>φ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = 2R \\arcsin\\!\\sqrt{\\sin^2\\!\\frac{\\Delta\\varphi}{2} + \\cos\\varphi_0 \\cos\\varphi_1 \\sin^2\\!\\frac{\\Delta\\lambda}{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.7634em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">arcsin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6766em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-4.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8719em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1208em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"to